## Interface: 16001
## Title: TargetKit
## Notes: Three one-key macros: TK Find (your find list, closest first, press again for the next), TK Pickpocket (closest humanoid not yet pickpocketed: Sap, then Pick Pocket) and TK Sap (mouseover, else the closest enemy player, stealthed ones the game reveals included). Type /tkit or click the minimap button: keys for the macros, the find list.
## Author: WoWForeverMoney (extras, not part of the app)
